(450,'market_launch','Honda CBR650R — 2019 European introduction replacing CBR650F','{"power":"70 kW at 12,000 rpm","engine":"Inline four-cylinder","comparison":"6 kg lighter than CBR650F","model_year":"2019","development":"Sportier riding position and longer side fairings","announcement_date":"6 November 2018"}'::jsonb,2019,NULL,'Europe','Honda Global — 2019 middleweight line-up, 6 November 2018','https://global.honda/en/newsroom/news/2018/2181106eng.html','manufacturer_primary_source_exact_model_checked_2026_11_12','Factory comparison with CBR650F, distinct from CB650R naked machine.','Honda Global — 2019 middleweight line-up, 6 November 2018'),
